🤖 ResumeAI — AI Resume Analyzer

ResumeAI is a modern and responsive web application designed to analyze resumes and provide useful insights for job seekers. It features a clean AI-powered interface with resume upload, ATS scoring, skill detection, missing skill identification, job-role suggestions, and resume improvement recommendations.

✨ Features

- 📄 Resume upload interface
- 📊 ATS compatibility score
- 🧠 AI-style resume analysis
- 💻 Detected skills
- ⚠️ Missing skills
- 💼 Suggested job role
- 💡 Resume improvement recommendations
- 📱 Fully responsive design
- 🎨 Modern AI/SaaS-style UI
- ⚡ Smooth animations and interactive elements

🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Responsive Web Design

🚀 Future Improvements

- Real AI API integration
- PDF/DOCX text extraction
- User authentication
- Job description matching
- Detailed ATS analysis
- Downloadable analysis reports
- Resume improvement suggestions based on specific job roles

📌 Project Status

Currently, this project is a frontend prototype. The AI analysis functionality is simulated and can be connected to a backend and AI API in future development.

